      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we want to just remove it completely? We should probably flip the toggle to a `disable_vertex_pulling` but otherwise, it could be useful to someone that\u0027s doing a native build, no? Like, if I guarantee that all my offsets are 4-byte aligned, then I don\u0027t need the extra work the polyfill interjects.",
