      "writtenOn": "2025-11-12T13:45:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The polyfill doesn\u0027t add a lot compared to what the driver already does: on AMD and Apple GPUs the driver does that polyfill already and left is Intel / Nvidia. But thinking more about it, I guess we could invert and do a Finch trial for Graphite later to check that on Intel it doesn\u0027t regress performance.",
